        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Alla Pugacheva, Igor Krutoy, Raimonds Pauls, Sandhy Sondoro\n- Events: New Wave\n- Places: Jūrmala, Latvia\n- Roles: musical performer, composer, pianist\n\nFacts:\n- Alla Pugacheva was born on 15 April 1949.\n- Alla Pugacheva is a Soviet and Russian musical performer.\n- Alla Pugacheva's career started in 1965 and continues to the present.\n- New Wave is an international contest for young performers of popular music founded in 2002 by Igor Krutoy and Raimonds Pauls.\n- New Wave was later enhanced by Alla Pugacheva.\n- Sandhy Sondoro won the 2009 International Contest of Young Pop Singer \"New Wave\" in Jūrmala, Latvia.",
